           inputs:  Use a mapping-stage batch where the fake model returns a partial answer set: at least one candidate test is answered, and at least one candidate test from the prompt is omitted entirely. Then feed that run into the reporting path that produces the conclusion/finding for unusable answers, so the test can check whether the missing-answer condition is surfaced while the conclusion is still present.
